{"uri": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3ms6qyrlim22d", "cid": "bafyreibrmcoes5x77pe4fl2ojtczzjguzlm3fdbgvex4xxy6hgqknzrt5i", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-08-03T14:56:16.098Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.images", "images": [{"alt": "", "aspectRatio": {"height": 1350, "width": 1080}, "image": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreib2stwlbhamqadhmh4lckxq57r4zwn5qkmcmjxn4el55vjbojpz6a"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 1373200}}]}, "facets": [{"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#link", "uri": "https://www.hachettebookgroup.com/titles/sherry-turkle/artificial-intimacy/9780316573962/"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 300, "byteStart": 259}}], "langs": ["en"], "text": "Jon Kabat-Zinn has spent decades encouraging us to become more present, with ourselves and with one another. I'm happy that he sees Artificial Intimacy as part of that larger conversation about presence, trust and what it means to live fully as human beings. www.hachettebookgroup.com/titles/sherr..."}, "indexedAt": "2026-08-03T14:56:20.565Z", "metrics": {"reply": 0, "repost": 1, "like": 3, "quote": 0, "bookmark": 0}, "authorDid": "did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk"}
{"uri": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3mrvb3dyczc2j", "cid": "bafyreibu5nlxutvgpnlajiuk4l7wwieijukz7uc2l5gjmk5xxluvuk4u5i", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-07-30T20:17:24.994Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.external", "external": {"description": "My Top Picks That Are Worth Your Time", "thumb": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreigvqd64bhrgmgpbpihhpbsxrd4eo4rmq5566g6xtkyxzvfgs5clfe"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 442864}, "title": "Zibby's Most Anticipated Fall Books", "uri": "https://www.zibbyowens.com/p/zibbys-most-anticipated-fall-books"}}, "langs": ["en"], "text": "I am a great fan of Zibby Owens and all she has done to increase enthusiasm for reading, readers, and authors. So I was so happy when she chose my new book, Artificial Intimacy, for her list of Most Anticipated Fall Books. Thank you!"}, "indexedAt": "2026-07-30T20:17:27.062Z", "metrics": {"reply": 0, "repost": 0, "like": 2, "quote": 0, "bookmark": 0}, "authorDid": "did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk"}
{"uri": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3mrscy4hrj224", "cid": "bafyreigpxozhg3q5k6qzs7frwvzrsvymdpu3ibn4o7x5xegj5lwulzakyu", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-07-29T16:13:24.716Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.images", "images": [{"alt": "", "aspectRatio": {"height": 1350, "width": 1080}, "image": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreid4g2gzzyfx27kcyna6wigkiuh6scyckpz4ptrgxuym746hcoejke"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 685903}}]}, "facets": [{"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#link", "uri": "https://www.hachettebookgroup.com/titles/sherry-turkle/artificial-intimacy/9780316573962/"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 273, "byteStart": 232}}], "langs": ["en"], "text": "I've admired Priya Parker's work on gathering, conversation, and human connection for many years. Her response to Artificial Intimacy is especially meaningful because my book is, at its heart, about protecting those very qualities. www.hachettebookgroup.com/titles/sherr..."}, "indexedAt": "2026-07-29T16:13:28.275Z", "metrics": {"reply": 0, "repost": 1, "like": 5, "quote": 0, "bookmark": 0}, "authorDid": "did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk"}
{"uri": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3mrfyuptiws2f", "cid": "bafyreifybucth556m3lg7wfrengozgt6ialx2xrnlmdshgy67xa676hxia", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-07-24T18:40:36.522Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.images", "images": [{"alt": "", "aspectRatio": {"height": 1350, "width": 1080}, "image": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreicrling2dlrovf4na4g7fq62ryqlijvq6twwwefwk5xnl7vulptm4"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 1366808}}]}, "facets": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet", "features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention", "did": "did:plc:jumkd2bzxfoazcqdmfexawmr"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 26, "byteStart": 0}}, {"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#link", "uri": "https://www.hachettebookgroup.com/titles/sherry-turkle/artificial-intimacy/9780316573962/"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 242, "byteStart": 201}}], "langs": ["en"], "text": "@jonathanhaidt.bsky.social and I have both spent years thinking about what technology is doing to children, families, and society. His generous words about Artificial Intimacy mean a great deal to me. www.hachettebookgroup.com/titles/sherr..."}, "indexedAt": "2026-07-24T18:40:42.469Z", "metrics": {"reply": 0, "repost": 0, "like": 1, "quote": 0, "bookmark": 0}, "authorDid": "did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk"}
{"uri": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3mr3ulhpz3s2p", "cid": "bafyreid6avfiuupfoack32wxijul7k5x5mqhpqxnxcuz4j2u3tdgqxznsi", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-07-20T17:57:13.677Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.images", "images": [{"alt": "", "aspectRatio": {"height": 1350, "width": 1080}, "image": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreihvotiztpj724miivq5qyndrewcwjtshsnfnezvedyuhmwgxozmvi"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 1849024}}]}, "facets": [{"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#link", "uri": "https://www.hachettebookgroup.com/titles/sherry-turkle/artificial-intimacy/9780316573962/"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 141, "byteStart": 100}}], "langs": ["en"], "text": "A starred review is always a thrill! Please support Artificial Intimacy with a preorder.\nThank you.\nwww.hachettebookgroup.com/titles/sherr..."}, "indexedAt": "2026-07-20T17:57:20.272Z", "metrics": {"reply": 0, "repost": 0, "like": 0, "quote": 0, "bookmark": 0}, "authorDid": "did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk"}
{"uri": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3mquaqkdrns2q", "cid": "bafyreidnjrly4bofrrnmkosbb5pcofsjd7jyuwd5hrbdhpgbjgbptgiuge", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-07-17T17:13:31.195Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.external", "external": {"description": "In the digital age, group chats have replaced diaries as the primary space where women process emotions, narrate their lives, and seek collective validation, comfort, and clarity.", "thumb": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreih6gcalizhbn53sv343l6podm2isgeldjzlydlhea33mo2zaqodny"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 596520}, "title": "Is the Group Chat the New Diary? Why So Many Women Process Life There First", "uri": "https://www.realsimple.com/is-the-group-chat-the-new-diary-12010220"}}, "langs": ["en"], "text": "Fifteen years after I wrote Alone Together, we're still asking how technology changes how we think, reflect, and connect. Today, that conversation extends beyond group chats to conversations with AI—a central question in my forthcoming book Artificial Intimacy."}, "indexedAt": "2026-07-17T17:13:33.869Z", "metrics": {"reply": 0, "repost": 1, "like": 3, "quote": 0, "bookmark": 0}, "authorDid": "did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk"}
{"uri": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3mqmphbcaik24", "cid": "bafyreifjusllga77anesw7wpqqea235bmhrykfyhspv5wrfrwpzcf5e6ey", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-07-14T17:15:27.939Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.external", "external": {"description": "You can now make a virtual replica of a loved one. The question is what it can give you in return.", "thumb": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreicx6parh2smkiwsliewzffrl45tz3sl637iusvk7mgrn3vlsamk44"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 342169}, "title": "Can A.I. Keep a Parent Alive?", "uri": "https://www.newyorker.com/news/as-told-to/can-ai-keep-a-parent-alive"}}, "facets": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet", "features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention", "did": "did:plc:t2dfq4ktezmwjdnjjaygw4bl"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 59, "byteStart": 45}}], "langs": ["en"], "text": "I loved Sam Wolson’s compelling article in @newyorker.com exploring what happens when we use AI to create avatars of the dead. In my forthcoming Artificial Intimacy, I explore how technology can interfere with mourning. Technology is being used, as it has always been, to make death seem less final."}, "indexedAt": "2026-07-14T17:15:29.671Z", "metrics": {"reply": 0, "repost": 0, "like": 1, "quote": 0, "bookmark": 1}, "authorDid": "did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk"}
{"uri": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3mq5hmhyxk226", "cid": "bafyreib4imsn4hv3wzggfb7asrvegnv4siq22vdlwnzlryl3goitmywheu", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-07-08T15:45:16.736Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.record", "record": {"cid": "bafyreibovh2mhk2p6nbsodptgi3cmoo5mpkkq6bexerux4rbraokf22u74", "uri": "at://did:plc:nyxviptfyic2lvuorkr5yy3y/app.bsky.feed.post/3mq53uoziyn26"}}, "facets": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet", "features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention", "did": "did:plc:nyxviptfyic2lvuorkr5yy3y"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 32, "byteStart": 16}}], "langs": ["en"], "text": "This article in @theatlantic.com is worth reading and discussing. There is a lot of talk about AI and writing, but not nearly enough about AI and reading. Using chatbots to summarize reading is a challenge to art, imagination, empathy, and the development of an integration of thought and feeling."}, "indexedAt": "2026-07-08T15:45:18.421Z", "metrics": {"reply": 0, "repost": 0, "like": 1, "quote": 0, "bookmark": 0}, "authorDid": "did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk"}
{"uri": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3mq3py4y5hk2v", "cid": "bafyreib52fjesatxs3scmk4ysol6c2h2zynzmczcmdkxdjgdatonuciwfm", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-07-07T23:09:38.286Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.external", "external": {"description": "For your intellectual travels this summer, a baker’s dozen of behavioral science books newly published this year.", "thumb": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreih4n2nfahvza2q3t7lcorh5yluvz6kwgnerf2ck7hciymvczcceeq"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 848346}, "title": "Behavioral Scientist’s Summer Book List 2026 - by Heather Graci and Evan Nesterak - Behavioral Scientist", "uri": "https://behavioralscientist.org/behavioral-scientists-summer-book-list-2026/"}}, "facets": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet", "features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention", "did": "did:plc:zkaifix3vninhd3yu2xz3oq5"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 88, "byteStart": 63}}], "langs": ["en"], "text": "I'm honored that Artificial Intimacy has been included in the \n@behscientist.bsky.social 2026 Summer Book List as one of four books to keep an eye out for this fall. It's especially meaningful to have the book recognized by a publication dedicated to helping readers better understand human behavior."}, "indexedAt": "2026-07-07T23:09:41.928Z", "metrics": {"reply": 0, "repost": 0, "like": 3, "quote": 0, "bookmark": 1}, "authorDid": "did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk"}
{"uri": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3mpmdlznwms22", "cid": "bafyreidvsz4dctjywgwvqifarbm4ntwu66yeahe65lrzk7vs7szkuwxog4", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-07-01T20:18:11.173Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.images", "images": [{"alt": "", "aspectRatio": {"height": 604, "width": 880}, "image": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreihigltfb2f7dil5esmjdifibycj2qfcxtmwhfdh5xkoulewds4aim"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 631949}}]}, "facets": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet", "features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention", "did": "did:plc:wesnugh2lq6x36yu5ymqxyeb"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 138, "byteStart": 111}}, {"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#link", "uri": "https://www.publishersweekly.com/pw/by-topic/new-titles/adult-announcements/article/100726-fall-2026-fiction-nonfiction-preview-science.html"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 180, "byteStart": 140}}], "langs": ["en"], "text": "Honored that my forthcoming book, Artificial Intimacy, is included in the Top 10 new science books for fall by @publisherswkly.bsky.social. www.publishersweekly.com/pw/by-topic/..."}, "indexedAt": "2026-07-01T20:18:14.326Z", "metrics": {"reply": 0, "repost": 0, "like": 2, "quote": 0, "bookmark": 0}, "authorDid": "did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk"}
{"uri": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3mp4wkcfwok25", "cid": "bafyreifhuxz45xthvsbhzj5nuic52rk5fkpuegjqhdoykw5gr5lshqp22q", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-06-25T17:14:38.523Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.external", "external": {"description": "Officials at a charter chain known for credit recovery made a couple of big-dollar purchases in the form of ChatGPT-powered robots. Researchers are skeptical they’re worth the dough.", "thumb": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreidcz7hskql6n2sajtevot6n6shephrqmgcbaupfzv3syl7btqaqne"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 690860}, "title": "A Charter School Spent $500,000 on AI-Powered Humanoid Robots. Was It Worth It?", "uri": "https://voiceofsandiego.org/2026/06/24/a-charter-school-spent-500000-on-ai-powered-humanoid-robots-was-it-worth-it/"}}, "langs": ["en"], "text": "AI humanoid robots in classrooms appeal because they promise everything, but they undermine learning. Education is getting the hard sell from the technology world, but it’s imperative to push back. In my new book, I describe how easily children are drawn into relationships with robots and chatbots."}, "indexedAt": "2026-06-25T17:14:41.070Z", "metrics": {"reply": 0, "repost": 1, "like": 1, "quote": 0, "bookmark": 0}, "authorDid": "did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk"}
{"uri": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3movkptd3f22m", "cid": "bafyreif2wdtccj2i5vwruhpaxhpy5a6g3zyvl6ipjn5ltsorvfedgffip4", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-06-22T18:54:20.954Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.images", "images": [{"alt": "", "aspectRatio": {"height": 602, "width": 880}, "image": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreid2kpkxgfu63mcmimktz6kjk7ngbqm2p4xj7halum4hvjc53silka"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 505476}}]}, "facets": [{"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#link", "uri": "https://www.amazon.com/Artificial-Intimacy-Become-When-Machines/dp/0316573965"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 194, "byteStart": 164}}], "langs": ["en"], "text": "There are some never-to-be-forgotten moments when you write a book. This weekend gave me one: My first reviews posted on Amazon's Editorial Reviews! I am thrilled. www.amazon.com/Artificial-I..."}, "indexedAt": "2026-06-22T18:54:23.968Z", "metrics": {"reply": 0, "repost": 1, "like": 1, "quote": 0, "bookmark": 0}, "authorDid": "did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk"}
{"uri": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3moidnzobqk2n", "cid": "bafyreicxl3aqgdg6hkx5a3ms6d2g2vefodr2pnmsz3qppbgnseuch35c2m", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-06-17T12:43:27.711Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.images", "images": [{"alt": "", "aspectRatio": {"height": 639, "width": 880}, "image": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreif272eoecxbm6aknwpoks4ubihzbmep4cpprentigdwztjuubrmhe"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 509820}}]}, "facets": [{"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#link", "uri": "https://www.publishersweekly.com/9780316573962"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 300, "byteStart": 262}}], "langs": ["en"], "text": "I was so happy to wake up this morning to a wonderful review from Publishers Weekly for my new book, Artificial Intimacy. I was particularly moved that they paused on the story of my trying to create a grief bot of my dead mother to comfort me. Read the review: www.publishersweekly.com/9780316573962"}, "indexedAt": "2026-06-17T12:43:30.565Z", "metrics": {"reply": 0, "repost": 2, "like": 5, "quote": 0, "bookmark": 2}, "authorDid": "did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk"}
{"uri": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3modi3ap7w22q", "cid": "bafyreibolcnehjretmlg5whxl3ccnynyu7oc3f4cc7jm5jxzzthw6jii7q", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-06-15T14:19:07.569Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.external", "external": {"description": "Most working hours now run through machines that shape what we decide. The unit psychology studies has changed. Here is what that means for measuring anything human.", "thumb": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreia53gwui4fkfwrii5i4xzqgqyvo7zg6ibm7f6naluisfdcdyflity"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 762706}, "title": "Psychology Is No Longer Alone", "uri": "https://www.psychologytoday.com/us/blog/the-adaptive-mind/202606/psychology-is-no-longer-alone"}}, "facets": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet", "features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention", "did": "did:plc:4prhycdira2fzjdh6ginrrir"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 68, "byteStart": 48}}], "langs": ["en"], "text": "I loved this shout-out to the arc of my work in @psychologytoday.com. First we talked to each other, then we talked to each other through machines. Now we talk directly to machines. In my new book, Artificial Intimacy, I ask: What is our endgame here?"}, "indexedAt": "2026-06-15T14:19:10.571Z", "metrics": {"reply": 0, "repost": 2, "like": 4, "quote": 0, "bookmark": 0}, "authorDid": "did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk"}
{"uri": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3mnsdfc6vec24", "cid": "bafyreichaivnszqqrvqde6psqbad5geq7spdt62bcc4hyqvofb3asblkku", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-06-08T18:40:00.411Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.images", "images": [{"alt": "", "aspectRatio": {"height": 2775, "width": 1838}, "image": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreib73hattmqldm5xg4i25s4n3trqjprjn7ivw3nfnscqmwgxepdlu4"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 1808756}}]}, "facets": [{"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#link", "uri": "https://www.hachettebookgroup.com/titles/sherry-turkle/artificial-intimacy/9780316573962/"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 298, "byteStart": 257}}], "langs": ["en"], "text": "In my new book, Artificial Intimacy. I trace the effects of our lives with chatbots from childhood to parenthood, from work to love, and more. I offer both a cautionary tale and a roadmap for being human in the age of AI. Out on September 29; preorder now: www.hachettebookgroup.com/titles/sherr..."}, "indexedAt": "2026-06-08T18:40:10.066Z", "metrics": {"reply": 1, "repost": 2, "like": 11, "quote": 2, "bookmark": 3}, "authorDid": "did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk"}
{"uri": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3mna4rgsbf22w", "cid": "bafyreifgnewzmhl6n53hoyddk537rizzvefnvfg763kq3zqxawsym5w7di", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-06-01T12:53:36.412Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.external", "external": {"description": "", "thumb": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreicp4vvew3f7vxlnp5wd52egbrfcikunsy2akvhr3wz6s5timvnue4"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 680718}, "title": "Top Mental Health & Therapy Leaders of 2026 | The Industry Leaders", "uri": "https://www.theindustryleaders.org/leaders/top-25-mental-health-therapy-leaders-2026"}}, "langs": ["en"], "text": "I'm very happy that the issue of “keeping AI in its lane”, when it comes to mental health care has come to prominence. For more on mental health care and AI, I have a new book coming out on September 29. Artificial Intimacy: Who We Become When We Talk To Machines."}, "indexedAt": "2026-06-01T12:53:39.071Z", "metrics": {"reply": 0, "repost": 0, "like": 4, "quote": 0, "bookmark": 1}, "authorDid": "did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk"}
{"uri": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3mmryzunb5s2c", "cid": "bafyreigbmq72g37xrzmuahf22rpec4balnn4dm5f6rhvbirw6kk6b5vq24", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-05-26T22:09:28.059Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.external", "external": {"description": "", "thumb": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreigmbb2m6ltb2jlzq54p2ewtuje2u3got7ifzgn3lab7ttimypqmdq"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 316916}, "title": "Human Algorithm Summit", "uri": "https://www.humanalgorithmsummit.com/"}}, "facets": [{"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#link", "uri": "https://www.humanalgorithmsummit.com/"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 267, "byteStart": 239}}], "langs": ["en"], "text": "I am so excited to be keynoting at the Human Algorithm Summit tomorrow, a gathering of scholars, developers, philanthropists, and activists who are dedicated, as I say in Artificial Intimacy, to keeping “AI in its lane.” Learn more at www.humanalgorithmsummit.com."}, "indexedAt": "2026-05-26T22:09:30.268Z", "metrics": {"reply": 0, "repost": 0, "like": 4, "quote": 0, "bookmark": 0}, "authorDid": "did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk"}
{"uri": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3mllsnpbzrk2p", "cid": "bafyreigwtbr7xi2gsh2w7nwqp2v3unypuz4bt3a2taeztnxmkuijj7jl7q", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-05-11T17:34:07.286Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.external", "external": {"description": "Stories abound of people falling in love or developing friendship with a chatbot. But that doesn’t actually solve the loneliness problem.", "thumb": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreibbraobdmesafu2w7g3vyx6h4nmgw4ocrcqkpqeufkgi2hvcy7ssy"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 653859}, "title": "Tech bros say AI may become your friend. Experts explain why it can’t | CNN", "uri": "https://edition.cnn.com/2026/05/09/health/ai-loneliness-kara-swisher-wellness"}}, "facets": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet", "features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention", "did": "did:plc:dwaduijo6ngdgzmir5vovzrh"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 114, "byteStart": 90}}, {"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#link", "uri": "https://edition.cnn.com/2026/05/09/health/ai-loneliness-kara-swisher-wellness"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 303, "byteStart": 272}}], "langs": ["en"], "text": "I  am so pleased to be featured in episode 3 of “Kara Swisher Wants To Live Forever.” @karaswisher.bsky.social explores whether our need for companionship can be satisfied by chatbots. The thesis of my new book, out in Sept., Artificial Intimacy, is that they cannot. edition.cnn.com/2026/05/09/h..."}, "indexedAt": "2026-05-11T17:34:10.175Z", "metrics": {"reply": 0, "repost": 3, "like": 6, "quote": 0, "bookmark": 0}, "authorDid": "did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk"}
{"uri": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3mkuzczndrk2o", "cid": "bafyreifzw5yuakvoiauh2ezkza4f7rmnmzkhty7d2n3f3asrpcoetptwla", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-05-02T16:02:11.254Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.external", "external": {"description": "How do we ensure the first generation growing up with AI thrives?Every generation is shaped by&nbsp;the&nbsp;technologies of its time.&nbsp;This generation is&…", "thumb": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreifhuqcalx7pobxa5hqi3vaz2r5vuhf4ufsckktb6edoxjpnznrhm4"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 937111}, "title": "AHA Symposium 2026: Raised by AI? – MIT Media Lab", "uri": "https://www.media.mit.edu/events/aha-symposium-raised-by-ai/"}}, "facets": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet", "features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention", "did": "did:plc:4ksu5lfwkyd7jtb2kjbma6pf"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 66, "byteStart": 45}}, {"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#link", "uri": "https://www.media.mit.edu/events/aha-symposium-raised-by-ai/"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 292, "byteStart": 259}}], "langs": ["en"], "text": "It was such a pleasure to participate in the @medialab.bsky.social AHA Symposium 2026: Raised by AI?. The panel on AI + the Future of Relationships (with me, Professor Rosalind Picard, and Nathan Barczi) was a great experience. Our panel starts at 28 minutes www.media.mit.edu/events/aha-s...."}, "indexedAt": "2026-05-02T16:02:14.273Z", "metrics": {"reply": 0, "repost": 0, "like": 1, "quote": 0, "bookmark": 1}, "authorDid": "did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk"}
{"uri": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3mfzhcuoho22u", "cid": "bafyreifahgt3ziiqtd6wh7kxb7hashpalm6wjidgp3axndbzdc2xjrynia", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-03-01T19:17:19.248Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.external", "external": {"description": "For some, artificial intelligence tools answer questions and make life more efficient. But for others, AI has become a form of companionship – a virtual friend, a therapist, even a romantic partner. I...", "thumb": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreie7iqp64cos6ynreheb2jwo52m35bjiou4dlwo7hmnuunte2rgose"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 878747}, "title": "Can AI companionship cure loneliness – or deepen it?", "uri": "https://www.pbs.org/newshour/podcasts/horizons-with-pbs-news/can-ai-companionship-cure-loneliness-or-deepen-it"}}, "facets": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet", "features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention", "did": "did:plc:dtwphuxvtvimwtra5yh4ujt4"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 80, "byteStart": 68}}, {"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet", "features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention", "did": "did:plc:pxsqpcmaybk654nbfc3az6co"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 103, "byteStart": 81}}], "langs": ["en"], "text": "It was great to talk about how chatbot relationships change us with @pbsnews.org @wbrangham.bsky.social, Justin Gregg, and Nick Thompson. I'm struck by the irony of social media platforms increasing the conditions for greater loneliness that they then say only a new technology, chatbots, can solve."}, "indexedAt": "2026-03-01T19:17:22.056Z", "metrics": {"reply": 1, "repost": 2, "like": 6, "quote": 0, "bookmark": 3}, "authorDid": "did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk"}
{"uri": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3mczfntdktk2s", "cid": "bafyreiaory5yefksbyis2otfkygpsrbwbe7nc6mygbs6wamoi4rsyzwk6q", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-01-22T14:32:04.570Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.images", "images": [{"alt": "", "aspectRatio": {"height": 1500, "width": 1000}, "image": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreich2nef6icquvo3h7m7xkm6jt73g324fmyvueclgy3xadqirapbma"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 736515}}, {"alt": "", "aspectRatio": {"height": 800, "width": 1200}, "image": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreihnyzhhrstq56j3uqpmfcbumtp23p2h3cvxbgtzm2snpwg2mpruwa"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 970891}}]}, "langs": ["en"], "text": "A pleasure to be on a panel at the WEF about risks and promise of generative AI where the focus was on what is best for people, not what is best for AIs. Can chatbots be made more transparent if this were truly a design goal? Can we make sites that encourage users to leave them and act in the world?"}, "indexedAt": "2026-01-22T14:32:10.057Z", "metrics": {"reply": 0, "repost": 0, "like": 1, "quote": 0, "bookmark": 2}, "authorDid": "did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk"}
{"uri": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3m6p3p6tdxs2g", "cid": "bafyreie6w5hbpcenzgmxul7emgph4fx3n4c2g4ujk4bnoujz4sdqavpcw4", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2025-11-28T14:26:28.867Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.external", "external": {"description": "", "thumb": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreihd4uixcmv2jcg4grkhpiugjqz3x22wonq63r4umvj6w2p5mncyy4"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 811854}, "title": "Need a Break from Your Phone? These Books Can Help.", "uri": "https://www.nytimes.com/2025/11/26/well/disconnect-from-phone.html?smid=em-share"}}, "facets": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet", "features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention", "did": "did:plc:ib4a64apjsvmleyi5xqz5m7x"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 129, "byteStart": 115}}], "langs": ["en"], "text": "So thrilled to be in Hope Reese's article on books to help you disconnect. To conversation! Needed more than ever! @hopereese.com"}, "indexedAt": "2025-11-28T14:26:31.931Z", "metrics": {"reply": 0, "repost": 3, "like": 8, "quote": 0, "bookmark": 0}, "authorDid": "did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk"}
{"uri": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3lxfqqd3zf22e", "cid": "bafyreie3qcg66pflcrtim46e5vxoahdvgpihj6fmsswjtttha6kkkg2mca", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2025-08-27T19:19:56.701Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.external", "external": {"description": "Sherry Turkle on AI, empathy, and the fight for human connection", "thumb": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreibsvyj4eridq6t7anolnpij7crbkj66rtg22szqfwacccg26s7hrm"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 952034}, "title": "Reclaiming Conversation in the Age of AI", "uri": "https://www.afterbabel.com/p/reclaiming-conversation-age-of-ai"}}, "facets": [{"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#link", "uri": "https://www.afterbabel.com/p/reclaiming-conversation-age-of-ai"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 45, "byteStart": 11}}], "langs": ["en"], "reply": {"parent": {"cid": "bafyreiaxq4djxvdfgossy7tna3ueo2utmyzybjxqpgh7hvouy4p3j6cxmi", "uri": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3lxfqktgcu22e"}, "root": {"cid": "bafyreiaxq4djxvdfgossy7tna3ueo2utmyzybjxqpgh7hvouy4p3j6cxmi", "uri": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3lxfqktgcu22e"}}, "text": "Read it at www.afterbabel.com/p/reclaiming...."}, "indexedAt": "2025-08-27T19:20:00.104Z", "metrics": {"reply": 0, "repost": 3, "like": 8, "quote": 0, "bookmark": 0}, "authorDid": "did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk", "replyTo": {"parent": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3lxfqktgcu22e", "parentAuthor": "sturkle.bsky.social", "root": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3lxfqktgcu22e", "rootAuthor": "sturkle.bsky.social"}}
{"uri": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3lxfqktgcu22e", "cid": "bafyreiaxq4djxvdfgossy7tna3ueo2utmyzybjxqpgh7hvouy4p3j6cxmi", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2025-08-27T19:16:52.486Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.images", "images": [{"alt": "", "aspectRatio": {"height": 859, "width": 560}, "image": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreielgqluw75oftgttuskdxu4vcp462p4vbjvmxi465mcc6zxhkgskm"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 214565}}]}, "facets": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet", "features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention", "did": "did:plc:jumkd2bzxfoazcqdmfexawmr"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 232, "byteStart": 206}}], "langs": ["en"], "text": "I’m so pleased for the publication of the tenth anniversary edition of Reclaiming Conversation, with my new introduction, a warning about our new love affair with artificial intimacy. And so pleased that @jonathanhaidt.bsky.social’s blog, After Babel, has published the new introduction."}, "indexedAt": "2025-08-27T19:16:55.311Z", "metrics": {"reply": 2, "repost": 5, "like": 20, "quote": 2, "bookmark": 0}, "authorDid": "did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk"}
{"uri": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3lrvxyfcygc25", "cid": "bafyreievkczb3ud74jn5fsfkmv6v3w3pzaivn2kgcuwysjbu3n6syuem4y", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2025-06-18T21:41:09.697Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.images", "images": [{"alt": "", "aspectRatio": {"height": 1350, "width": 1080}, "image": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreici4kqiyfftse5bw3peajxuyrkftoiyhziu36me3avebpdvx3swji"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 792388}}]}, "langs": ["en"], "text": "Are you talking to technology? If yes, we're interested in talking to you! We are MIT researchers studying how AI chat affects work and family life. We’re especially looking for legal, medical, IT pros—and parents using AI with kids. Interviews are confidential. Email aichatlife@gmail.com to join!"}, "indexedAt": "2025-06-18T21:41:14.049Z", "metrics": {"reply": 0, "repost": 2, "like": 6, "quote": 1, "bookmark": 0}, "authorDid": "did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk"}
{"uri": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3lmmztr32cs2d", "cid": "bafyreigs72gcg3iwzoshl7zbwxfud4aw6xjgeqr75bpkfcmp3wz42wakl4", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2025-04-12T17:14:25.950Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.external", "external": {"description": "As AI systems grow more emotionally fluent, Professor Sherry Turkle warns we may be trading genuine human connection for simulated comfort, at MIT’s AHA symposium.", "thumb": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreifuspnpzyfbue4qsojtqdwqn2rien3psb7zg4gzn6j26pdjxrksdq"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 496613}, "title": "The Human Cost Of Talking To Machines: Can A Chatbot Really Care?", "uri": "https://www.forbes.com/sites/traceyfollows/2025/04/10/the-human-cost-of-talking-to-machines-can-a-chatbot-really-care/"}}, "facets": [{"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#link", "uri": "https://www.forbes.com/sites/traceyfollows/2025/04/10/the-human-cost-of-talking-to-machines-can-a-chatbot-really-care/"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 69, "byteStart": 39}}, {"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet", "features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention", "did": "did:plc:gpcbiejyc7pqrftroezsk3rq"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 147, "byteStart": 128}}, {"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet", "features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention", "did": "did:plc:4ksu5lfwkyd7jtb2kjbma6pf"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 174, "byteStart": 153}}], "langs": ["en"], "text": "The launch of AI for human flourishing www.forbes.com/sites/tracey... was a day of great conversations! Thank you, Pattie Maes, @patpat.bsky.social, and @medialab.bsky.social."}, "indexedAt": "2025-04-12T17:14:28.679Z", "metrics": {"reply": 2, "repost": 2, "like": 17, "quote": 0, "bookmark": 0}, "authorDid": "did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk"}
{"uri": "at://did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk/app.bsky.feed.post/3llhherdtik2w", "cid": "bafyreidhn4ctn74cjwsano5k5pzkqr3q23f3itz3lhsvcclwzf42mxujsa", "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2025-03-28T18:35:25.250Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.external", "external": {"description": "Can we design AI to support&nbsp;human flourishing?", "thumb": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreidujpmdl4xjo562lh5s3d6donlwbeylwbhz6gnom2z4inctezqrj4"}, "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "size": 222925}, "title": "Can we design AI to support human flourishing? | AHA Symposium 2025 – MIT Media Lab", "uri": "https://www.media.mit.edu/events/aha-symposium/"}}, "facets": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet", "features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention", "did": "did:plc:4ksu5lfwkyd7jtb2kjbma6pf"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 85, "byteStart": 64}}, {"features": [{"$type": "app.bsky.richtext.facet#link", "uri": "https://www.media.mit.edu/events/aha-symposium/"}], "index": {"byteEnd": 202, "byteStart": 169}}], "langs": ["en"], "text": "I am so looking forward to what promises to be a compelling day @medialab.bsky.social. My most cherished colleagues across generations are participating. Learn more at www.media.mit.edu/events/aha-s...."}, "indexedAt": "2025-03-28T18:35:27.605Z", "metrics": {"reply": 1, "repost": 3, "like": 10, "quote": 0, "bookmark": 1}, "authorDid": "did:plc:qrmqs7nwiu45g42cdpn37bjk"}
